 "title": "2.7 有理数的混合运算",
 "label": "七上·2.7",
 "part": "七上 第2章 有理数",
 "url": "https://basic.smartedu.cn/tchMaterial/detail?contentType=assets_document&contentId=01e365c7-9178-4155-8640-c862c5eff5e6&catalogType=tchMaterial&subCatalog=tchMaterial",
 "paragraphs": [
  "小学里，进行加、减、乘、除混合运算的顺序是“先乘除，后加减，如果有括号，先进行括号内的运算”。对于有理数的混合运算，如计算",
  "$$8-2^3\\div(-4)\\times(-7+5),$$",
  "这个算式中含有有理数的加、减、乘、除、乘方运算，一般有以下运算顺序：",
  "先乘方，后乘除，再加减。如果有括号，先进行括号内的运算。",
  "根据这样的运算顺序，我们可以有步骤地进行运算，如：",
  "$$",
  "\\begin{aligned}",
  "&8-2^3\\div(-4)\\times(-7+5)\\\\",
  "=&8-2^3\\div(-4)\\times(-2)\\\\",
  "=&8-8\\div(-4)\\times(-2)\\\\",
  "=&8-4\\\\",
  "=&4.",
  "\\end{aligned}",
  "$$",
  "例1",
  "计算：$9+5\\times(-3)-(-2)^2\\div4$.",
  "解",
  "$$",
  "\\begin{aligned}",
  "&9+5\\times(-3)-(-2)^2\\div4\\\\",
  "=&9+5\\times(-3)-4\\div4\\\\",
  "=&9-15-1\\\\",
  "=&-7.",
  "\\end{aligned}",
  "$$",
  "例2",
  "计算：$(-5)^3\\times[2-(-6)]-300\\div5$.",
  "解",
  "$$",
  "\\begin{aligned}",
  "&(-5)^3\\times[2-(-6)]-300\\div5\\\\",
  "=&(-5)^3\\times8-300\\div5\\\\",
  "=&(-125)\\times8-300\\div5\\\\",
  "=&-1000-60\\\\",
  "=&-1060.",
  "\\end{aligned}",
  "$$",
  "练习",
  "计算：",
  "（1）$16-8\\div(-4)\\times(-2)$；",
  "（2）$3^3+24\\div(-2)^3\\div(-9)$；",
  "（3）$(-2)^5\\div(4-2^3)$；",
  "（4）$\\left(8+4\\div\\frac{1}{4}\\right)\\div(-3)+(-2)^2$.",
  "例3",
  "计算：$\\left(-\\frac{1}{3}\\right)\\times3\\div3\\times\\left(-\\frac{1}{3}\\right)$.",
  "解",
  "$\\left(-\\frac{1}{3}\\right)\\times3\\div3\\times\\left(-\\frac{1}{3}\\right)$",
  "$=(-1)\\times\\frac{1}{3}\\times\\left(-\\frac{1}{3}\\right)$",
  "$=\\left(-\\frac{1}{3}\\right)\\times\\left(-\\frac{1}{3}\\right)$",
  "$=\\frac{1}{9}$.",
  "例4",
  "计算：$\\left(-\\frac{1}{4}-\\frac{5}{6}+\\frac{8}{9}\\right)\\div\\left(-\\frac{1}{6}\\right)^2+(-2)^3\\times(-7)$.",
  "解",
  "$\\left(-\\frac{1}{4}-\\frac{5}{6}+\\frac{8}{9}\\right)\\div\\left(-\\frac{1}{6}\\right)^2+(-2)^3\\times(-7)$",
  "$=\\left(-\\frac{1}{4}-\\frac{5}{6}+\\frac{8}{9}\\right)\\times36+(-8)\\times(-7)$",
  "$=-\\frac{1}{4}\\times36-\\frac{5}{6}\\times36+\\frac{8}{9}\\times36+56$",
  "$=-9-30+32+56$",
  "$=49$.",
  "活动",
  "两个人一组，开展活动：一个人在数轴上任选两个有理数对应的点，并用这两个有理数组成算式，另一个人在数轴上标出运算结果对应的点．例如，甲选择$-2$，$3$对应的点$A$，$B$，组成算式",
  "$(-2)\\div3$，$(-2)\\times3$，$(-2)^3$等，",
  "乙在数轴上标出运算结果对应的点$C$，$D$，$E$等（图2-16）．",
  "（图2-16）",
  "练习",
  "计算：",
  "（1）$\\left(\\frac{1}{4}-\\frac{5}{6}+\\frac{1}{3}+\\frac{3}{2}\\right)\\div\\left(-\\frac{1}{2}\\right)^2$；",
  "（2）$\\left(\\frac{1}{3}-\\frac{1}{2}\\right)\\times(-6)+\\left(-\\frac{1}{2}\\right)^2\\div\\left(-\\frac{1}{2}\\right)^3$；",
  "（3）$-1^4-[2-(-3)^2]$．",
  "计算器操作",
  "进行有理数混合运算，只要按算式依次输入数字和符号，输入完毕后，按等号键$\\boxed{=}$，即得运算结果．",
  "例 计算：$(-3.2+4.5)\\div3^2$．",
  "解：依次按以下各键：$\\boxed{(}\\boxed{(-)}\\boxed{3}\\boxed{\\cdot}\\boxed{2}\\boxed{+}\\boxed{4}\\boxed{\\cdot}\\boxed{5}\\boxed{)}\\boxed{\\div}\\boxed{3}\\boxed{x^2}\\boxed{=}$．",
  "计算器显示的结果为0.048 148 148 15．",
